{"id":"beherrscht","lemma":"beherrscht","pos":"adj","rank":4369,"glosses":["restrained, self-controlled","ruled, governed, dominated"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9b/De-beherrscht.ogg/De-beherrscht.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"beherrschter","superlative":"am beherrschtesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Beherrscht euch.","en":"Control yourselves.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/389748","words":[null,{"g":"you (pl.)","l":"ihr"}]},{"text":"Du bist beherrschter als die meisten Menschen.","en":"You have more restraint than most people.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"human","l":"Mensch"}]},{"text":"Sie beherrscht Französisch.","en":"She is proficient in French.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"French, fellatio"}]},{"text":"Er beherrscht die Kunst, sich Freunde zu machen.","en":"He knows the art of making friends.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"art"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"friends"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Dinosaurier haben einst die Erde beherrscht.","en":"Dinosaurs once ruled the earth.","words":[{"g":"dinosaur"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"once, formerly"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"earth"},null]}]}